= Manuel Cordero

Cordero is a veteran <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span> and <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> figure and the party's point man on labour legislation, working closely with the Labour Ministry. His priority is to improve conditions for organized workers.

